/target
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.ser
serial.log

# Console firmware and license blobs are large, proprietary and machine
# specific. They belong in RPCS3/Wine on the machine, never in this history:
# a committed blob cannot be removed, bloats every clone, and is not source.
*.PUP
*.pup
*.rap
*.RAP
*.edat
*.EDAT
*.bios
*.bin
